  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana-Netherlands WASH Programme Workshop 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Embassy in Accra, Ghana, and RVO engaged a (local) contractor to arrange a workshop, which brings the partners of 20 projects in Ghana, five administered by the Embassy and fifteen by RVO, together in a stakeholders&apos; dialogue with sixty to seventy participants. This workshop is the third meeting, with similar meetings held in Accra in February 2017 and November 2015. Participants appreciated these meetings as they brought together all stakeholders (project representatives, RVO advisors and representatives from the Dutch Embassy). The meetings allow time and space to discuss the projects&apos; progress, learn from each other&apos;s experiences and find cross-linkages and their synergy. The meeting reinforces the commitment among all partners to make a sustainable and significant impact in Ghana.</narrative>
  </description>
